{"availability":"available","full":"johncalvinroberts/pprmnt","name":"pprmnt","description":"Wasm MP3 encoder","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":53,"forks":3,"created":"2020-04-12T14:20:42Z","updated":"2025-10-01T03:49:26Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pprmnt.cc/","topics":["offline","pwa","webassembly"],"demo":"https://pprmnt.cc/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:47.352Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:47.352Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:47.352Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:22:47.352Z","stars":53,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A secure MP3 encoder, powered by Web Assembly. Try it out.","First, why do I need this: I'm a beatmaker, I make beats. When I send beats to other people, or upload them to my website, I need to first convert them to MP3. The lossless WAV version that my DAW spits out is way too big to send easily, and also causes performance issues when uploading online.","Secondly, why might other people need this: Musicians are often in a similar situation, needing to send a quick MP3 instead of a huge WAV file. Musicians often seek out easy-to-use online \"convert to MP3 online\" websites -- websites which require upload to a remote server. They perform the MP3 encoding on the backend, not on the client."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/johncalvinroberts/pprmnt/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"075f0b78b6fd34cc87beea23c1de9ba91527261f5cdeb785c9293e0aab995754","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:47.707Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:47.707Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A secure MP3 encoder, powered by Web Assembly. Try it out.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/johncalvinroberts/pprmnt/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"075f0b78b6fd34cc87beea23c1de9ba91527261f5cdeb785c9293e0aab995754","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/johnca